计算正弦和的闭式**  
利用三角求和公式  
$$\sum_{k=1}^{m}\sin kx=\frac{\sin\frac{mx}{2}\,\sin\frac{(m+1)x}{2}}{\sin\frac{x}{2}},$$  
取 $m=n-1,\;x=\dfrac{\pi}{n}$，得  
$$\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\sin\frac{k\pi}{n}
=\frac{\sin\frac{(n-1)\pi}{2n}\cdot\sin\frac{\pi}{2}}{\sin\frac{\pi}{2n}}
=\frac{\cos\frac{\pi}{2n}}{\sin\frac{\pi}{2n}}
=\cot\frac{\pi}{2n}.$$

**

求上下界的极限**  
记 $t=\dfrac{\pi}{2n}\to0^{+}$，则  
$$n\cot\frac{\pi}{2n}
=\frac{\pi}{2}\cdot\frac{\cos t}{t\sin t}
\sim\frac{\pi}{2}\cdot\frac{1}{t^{2}}
=\frac{2n^{2}}{\pi}.$$  
因此  
$$\frac{n\cot(\pi/2n)}{n^{2}}\longrightarrow\frac{2}{\pi}.$$  

上界：  
$$U_n=\frac{n}{n^{2}+1}\cot\frac{\pi}{2n}
=\frac{n\cot(\pi/2n)}{n^{2}}\cdot\frac{n^{2}}{n^{2}+1}
\longrightarrow\frac{2}{\pi}\cdot1=\frac{2}{\pi}.$$  

下界：  
$$L_n=\frac{n}{n^{2}+n}\cot\frac{\pi}{2n}
=\frac{n\cot(\pi/2n)}{n^{2}}\cdot\frac{n^{2}}{n^{2}+n}
\longrightarrow\frac{2}{\pi}\cdot1=\frac{2}{\pi}.$$

